## 👥 Configured Agent Topology

| Role | Agent & Model | Concurrency | Capabilities & Orca Utilities |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Lead Coordinator** | $(fmt_md_cell "$COORD_AGENT" "$COORD_MODEL") | 1 | Task DAG, Zero-Trust Audit, Decision Gates, Release |
